1
00:00:08,149 --> 00:00:09,439
(Penny:)Oh, hi. What's going on?

2
00:00:09,608 --> 00:00:12,108
(Leonard:)We're up on the roof
bouncing laser beams off the moon.

3
00:00:12,945 --> 00:00:14,275
(Penny:)I'm sorry, what?

4
00:00:14,446 --> 00:00:17,576
It's cool. We've got a two-meter
parabolic reflector and everything.

5
00:00:17,741 --> 00:00:20,281
-I thought you might wanna see it.
-That makes no sense.

6
00:00:21,453 --> 00:00:25,293
(Man:)How can you bounce stuff off the moon?
There's no gravity.

7
00:00:26,917 --> 00:00:29,007
Oh, Leonard, this is Zack. Zack, Leonard.

8
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:31,090
(Leonard:)-Hey.
-Sorry, I didn't know you were busy.

9
00:00:31,255 --> 00:00:32,795
(Leonard:)-Maybe another time.
-Yeah. Maybe.

10
00:00:32,965 --> 00:00:35,885
-Hey, I wanna see this laser thing.
-Oh, what about the party?

11
00:00:36,051 --> 00:00:39,301
(Zack:)It's a surprise party,
doesn't matter when we get there.

12
00:00:40,514 --> 00:00:42,054
(Howard:)Right.

13
00:00:42,474 --> 00:00:43,894
(Leonard:)Okay, well, yeah, come on up.

14
00:00:50,357 --> 00:00:51,687
LEONARD:
So how'd you guys meet?

15
00:00:51,859 --> 00:00:55,149
ZACK: My company designs the menus
for The Cheesecake Factory.

16
00:00:55,321 --> 00:00:56,321
LEONARD:
Your company?

17
00:00:56,488 --> 00:00:59,328
ZACK:
My dad, but me and my sister are VPs.

18
00:01:00,034 --> 00:01:02,324
LEONARD:
So menus.

